# Battle at Grayfall Keep (plan 41 · EG9): the gatherer's show and the leaders she lured, a quick, bright, taunting waltz
# in D minor (the outline sheet's 16b) that plays in the hub wherever the villain teams' leaders battle: a violin's
# runs over pizzicato chords on the second and third beats, horns punching the first, a bowed bass. Original composition
# for this game, in the classic sound.
title Battle! Grayfall Keep
tempo 200
meter 3/4
lowhptempo 1.08
reverb 0.24

track lead violin lowhp=sawlead vol=0.7 pan=0 rev=0.22
  o5 d8 e8 f8 g8 a8 b-8 | o5 a2. |
  L o6 d4 o5 a8 f8 d4 | o5 e8 f8 g8 f8 e4 | o5 c+4 e8 g8 b-4 | o5 a2 r4 |
  o6 d4 o5 a8 f8 d4 | o5 g8 a8 b-8 a8 g4 | o5 f8 g8 a8 g8 f8 e8 | o5 d2 r4 |
  o5 b-4 o6 d8 c8 o5 b-4 | o5 a4 f8 g8 a4 | o5 g4 b-8 a8 g4 | o5 e4 c+8 d8 e4 |
  o6 d8 c8 o5 b-8 a8 g8 f8 | o5 e8 f8 g8 a8 b-8 o6 c+8 | o6 d4 o5 a4 f4 | o5 d2 r4 |

